+# Third-party & data-handling audit
+
+Run before adding any third-party resource, and at least annually.
+
+## Current inventory (2026-10-16)
+| Item | Status |
+| --- | --- |
+| Third-party scripts / fonts / analytics | None |
+| Third-party images | Removed: the Unsplash hero is now self-hosted (`assets/hero.jpg`), so visitor IPs are no longer sent to a third party |
+| Cookies / localStorage | None |
+| npm dependencies | None (`server.js` uses Node built-ins only; replaced `statikk` via `pnpm dlx`) |
+| Forms / personal data collected | None |
+
+## Checklist for any new vendor
+- [ ] Is the data it receives necessary? Can it be self-hosted instead?
+- [ ] DPA signed; sub-processors and data location reviewed
+- [ ] Minimal CSP allowance added (specific origin, never `*`)
+- [ ] Subresource Integrity on any external script/style
+- [ ] Documented in `privacy-policy.html`
+- [ ] Run `pnpm audit` and review changelog/maintainers for new packages
