+<!DOCTYPE html>
+<html lang="en">
+
+<head>
+  <meta charset="UTF-8">
+  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
+  <meta name="referrer" content="strict-origin-when-cross-origin">
+  <title>Privacy Policy | The Daily Grind</title>
+  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/styles.css">
+</head>
+
+<body>
+  <nav>
+    <div class="logo">THE DAILY GRIND</div>
+    <ul>
+      <li><a href="/">Home</a></li>
+    </ul>
+  </nav>
+
+  <main class="container legal">
+    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
+    <p>Last updated: 16 October 2026</p>
+
+    <h2>What we collect</h2>
+    <p>This website collects only what is needed to deliver pages to you. Our server does not set cookies, run
+      analytics or advertising trackers, or load scripts, fonts, or images from third parties.</p>
+    <ul>
+      <li>Standard request data (IP address, requested page) is processed transiently to serve the page and is not
+        stored by the application.</li>
+      <li>If you create an account or place an order, we will collect only the details required for that purpose
+        (such as name, email, and order contents).</li>
+    </ul>
+
+    <h2>How we protect it</h2>
+    <ul>
+      <li>All assets are served from our own origin; no third-party requests are made from your browser.</li>
+      <li>Strict security headers (CSP, HSTS, frame, referrer, and permissions policies) are applied to every response.</li>
+      <li>We retain personal data only as long as necessary and delete it on request.</li>
+    </ul>
+
+    <h2>Third parties and audits</h2>
+    <p>Any service provider that processes personal data on our behalf must pass a security and privacy review
+      before onboarding, sign a data processing agreement, and be re-audited at least annually. We review this site's
+      dependencies and headers on the same schedule.</p>
+
+    <h2>Your rights</h2>
+    <p>You may request access to, correction of, or deletion of your data. Contact us via the
+      <a href="/contact">Contact Us</a> page or <a href="mailto:privacy@dailygrind.example">privacy@dailygrind.example</a>.</p>
+  </main>
+
+  <footer>
+    <p>&copy; 2026 The Daily Grind Coffee Co. All rights reserved.</p>
+  </footer>
+</body>
+
+</html>
